---
layout: base.njk
title: "About GS Visibility | SEO Specialists for Small Businesses"
description: "GS Visibility is an SEO team led by Bhawani Shankar, working remotely with small businesses in Europe and Australia on technical, on-page and local SEO."
---
{% from "breadcrumbs.njk" import crumbs %}
{{ crumbs([{name: "Home", url: "/"}, {name: "About", url: "/about/"}], site.url) }}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}/about/#webpage",
      "url": "{{ site.url }}/about/",
      "name": {{ title | dump | safe }},
      "isPartOf": {"@id": "{{ site.url }}/#website"},
      "about": {"@id": "{{ site.url }}/#organization"},
      "inLanguage": "{{ site.locale }}"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}/about/#founder",
      "name": {{ site.founder | dump | safe }},
      "jobTitle": "SEO Specialist",
      "worksFor": {"@id": "{{ site.url }}/#organization"},
      "sameAs": "{{ site.linkedin }}",
      "knowsAbout": ["Technical SEO", "On-page SEO", "Local SEO", "Keyword research", "International SEO", "Generative engine optimisation"]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About GS Visibility</h1>
    <p class="lede">An SEO team that works with small businesses in Europe and Australia, and explains what it is doing in plain English.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap about-grid prose">
    <div>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Who we are</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>GS Visibility is led by {{ site.founder }}, a freelance SEO specialist who has worked hands-on auditing sites and growing organic traffic for real clients. Today that work is done by a team, with the same focus on practical fixes you can see.</p>
      <p>{{ site.founder }} holds the International SEO certification from Semrush Academy and a NAVTTC-affiliated certification in Digital Marketing and SEO, and has studied the fundamentals of GEO and AEO: making sure your content also appears correctly in AI-generated answers, not only in traditional search results.</p>
      <p>We work remotely from {{ site.location }} and schedule calls around your time zone. If you have been burned by a generic "SEO package" before, this is built for you: realistic timelines, plain-English updates and work you can actually see.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <div class="value-grid">
      <div class="value"><h3>Fix, do not just report</h3><p>Every audit ends with problems fixed where we can, and a clear list of anything that needs your decision.</p></div>
      <div class="value"><h3>Built around your market</h3><p>Research is done for your country and your language variant, not a generic global keyword list.</p></div>
      <div class="value"><h3>Plain English</h3><p>Monthly updates you can read without a glossary, with what changed, why it matters and what comes next.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Talk to us about your website</h2>
    <p>Tell us what you sell and where your customers are, and we will tell you honestly where the biggest SEO opportunities are.</p>
    <div class="contact-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact/">Get a free mini-audit</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-details">
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
